why was melissa roush's appearance as a  marvel superhero quite so short and why  did she jump over to the dc universe  soon after keep watching during its  12-season run the big bang theory was  beloved by audiences all over the world  the series became something of an award  magnet as the years went on netting  several primetime emmys among other  notable prizes it famously thrust nerd  culture into the mainstream which no  other sitcom had ever done with such  unapologetic aplomb of course there was  also the comedy's stable of characters  and the actors who played them that  drove the series for the duration of its  run by the time the big bang theory left  the small screen in 2019 its main cast  had grown to include eight names jim  parsons played sheldon cooper kaylee  cuoco starred as penny teller johnny  galecki was leonard hofstadter mayam  bialik played amy farah fowler simon  hellberg starred as howard wallace kunal  neher was raj kuthrapali and melissa  rausch played bernadette rostinkowski  not only was the big bang theory steady  work for its stars they were compensated  handsomely for their efforts too  nevertheless a well-paying job didn't  stop some of its stars from exploring  other creative avenues in the case of  melissa roush she even visited the  marvel universe for a spell during her  big bang theory tenure but you might not  realize who she played two years after  the character's arrival in the marvel  cinematic universe in which he was  portrayed by paul rudd ant-man became  the lead of his own animated series  simply titled ant-man the series of  shorts saw the titular shrinking hero  stand toe-to-toe against a variety of  villains pulled from his comic book  counterparts rogues gallery including  yellowjacket josh keaton of voltron  legendary defender and hercules fame  took on the show's lead voice role but  his two-dimensional take on scott lang  couldn't save the world from evil on its  own alongside dee bradley baker's hank  pym bernadette rostinkowski actor  melissa roush joined the fray as hope  pym also known as the wasp fans of the  marvel cinematic universe are already  familiar with her character who is  portrayed by evangeline lilly in the  original 2015 movie and the 2018 film  ant-man and the wasp in those movies her  character is named hope van dyne bearing  the surname of her mother janet van dyne  who wore the wasp suit in a previous  life lily's take on the character is a  distinct entity from her comic book  progenitor in several key ways roush's  wasp meanwhile retains the name hope pym  from the comic book source material thus  maintaining some characteristics that  fell by the wayside when the character  was adapted for the mcu sadly for fans  of the actor and the wasp character  alike roush only appeared in two of the  ant-man cartoon's six episodes in the  first alien invasion the episode opens  with ant-man bragging to the wasp about  a prior mission when an alarm goes off  in his lab signaling that an armada of  tiny aliens is approaching ant-man and  the wasp then team up and promptly stop  them in her second appearance on the  show in an episode titled not a date  hank and hope are enjoying a day out  with one another out of costume when the  villainous whirlwind attacks that's no  ordinary tornado it's whirlwind one of  my dad's enemies fortunately the two  heroes are prepared for such an occasion  and quickly suit up allowing them to  fight their adversary ant-man and the  wasp alternately use their growth and  shrinking abilities to take them down  all the while arguing about whether or  not their outing constitutes a date in  the end roush's time as the wasp  amounted to a rather short run as the  marvel comics mainstay thankfully she  ended up with a much more significant  spotlight under the dc comics banner  when she got to voice fan favorite  harley quinn in the 2017 batman and  harley quinn animated feature all in all  melissa roush's marvel legacy doesn't  come anywhere close to that of  present-day mcu staple evangeline lilly  but at least she got to voice the  character for a little while perhaps  someday she'll return to the world of  marvel in a more substantial part  check out one of our newest videos right  here plus even more looper videos about  your favorite movies are coming soon  subscribe to our youtube channel and hit  the bell so you don't miss a single one  [Applause]  [Music]  [Applause]  [Music]  you
 

